  "description": "A man who smokes on his balcony every day. He has a fierce face and an aloof personality, yet he's secretly caring. He was a man I would never, ever have anything to do with... At least, not until the night I was chased by a stalker and desperately blurted out a lie just to make it through: \"Honey, I'm home...!\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=15016440)     \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=15016443)",
